WEBVTT

1
00:50:52.746 --> 00:50:58.746
Jesus, I pray that you will accept our hearts as a pleasing offering.

2
00:50:58.746 --> 00:51:03.746
We want to glorify you for who you are and we want to give everything to you.

3
00:51:03.746 --> 00:51:06.746
We want to give everything from our lives to you.

4
00:51:06.746 --> 00:51:08.746
More than anything.

5
00:51:08.746 --> 00:51:14.746
Lord, help us to give everything to you, every time again.

6
00:51:14.746 --> 00:51:19.746
Lord, every time we sang this, I think of those words more than anything.

7
00:51:19.746 --> 00:51:22.746
Everything must be for King Jesus.

8
00:51:22.746 --> 00:51:29.746
Seek first God's kingdom and all other things will come in second place, and in third place, and in fourth place.

9
00:51:29.746 --> 00:51:33.746
But give Jesus everything in your life.

10
00:51:33.746 --> 00:51:36.746
Give Him your joy. Give Him your peace.

11
00:51:36.746 --> 00:51:39.746
Give Him your laughter. Give Him your crying.

12
00:51:39.746 --> 00:51:42.746
Give Him your joy. Give Him your sorrow.

13
00:51:42.746 --> 00:51:45.746
Give your anger to Him. Give your money to Him.

14
00:51:45.746 --> 00:51:48.746
Give your free time to Him. Give your energy to Him.

15
00:51:48.746 --> 00:51:51.746
Give your wisdom to Him. Give your opinion to Him.

16
00:51:51.746 --> 00:51:55.746
Lay it down at the cross. Give it to King Jesus.

17
00:51:55.746 --> 00:52:00.746
For everything, more than anything, is His name, King Jesus.

18
00:52:00.746 --> 00:52:03.746
Everything must be for the Lord, people.

19
00:52:03.746 --> 00:52:06.746
Everything, everything, everything must be for the Lord.

20
00:52:06.746 --> 00:52:12.746
Your marriage, your communication, the things you do in life, where you go.

21
00:52:12.746 --> 00:52:14.746
Everything must be for Jesus.

22
00:52:14.746 --> 00:52:18.746
And when you bring everything under His lordship,

23
00:52:18.746 --> 00:52:21.746
only then do you grasp the full glory of Jesus.

24
00:52:21.746 --> 00:52:24.746
And that is available for everyone.

25
00:52:24.746 --> 00:52:26.746
People, look at me.

26
00:52:26.746 --> 00:52:30.746
Did you know that it is not difficult at all to give everything to Jesus?

27
00:52:30.746 --> 00:52:35.746
It is not a heart-wrenching struggle, it is not a toil to give Him everything.

28
00:52:35.746 --> 00:52:39.746
It is a song. It is a tune.

29
00:52:39.746 --> 00:52:43.746
It is an emotion that you give to Him. It is opening your heart.

30
00:52:43.746 --> 00:52:47.746
It is not difficult, well now I have to do this, now I have to do that.

31
00:52:47.746 --> 00:52:51.746
No, you just have to say, Holy Spirit, more than anything.

32
00:52:51.746 --> 00:52:54.746
Why do you think we sing songs in church?

33
00:52:54.746 --> 00:52:56.746
It is so that you can open your heart.

34
00:52:56.746 --> 00:53:00.746
And that you can close your eyes and say, okay, more than anything.

35
00:53:00.746 --> 00:53:03.746
Can the lights come on? I would like to see everyone.

36
00:53:03.746 --> 00:53:06.746
Did you know that Jesus loves you, people?

37
00:53:06.746 --> 00:53:08.746
Did you know that He loves you?

38
00:53:08.746 --> 00:53:11.746
Can I get a bit more enthusiasm? Jesus loves you.

39
00:53:11.746 --> 00:53:18.746
And did you know, He loves you so much. He loves you so much that He died on a cross.

40
00:53:18.746 --> 00:53:23.746
More than anything, He said initially about you.

41
00:53:23.746 --> 00:53:30.746
For you see, we often say this, that Jesus was Creator and He was already king.

42
00:53:30.746 --> 00:53:35.746
Philippians chapter 2, verses 6 to 11. Great, that was all already.

43
00:53:35.746 --> 00:53:40.746
But did you know there was something else He desired even more?

44
00:53:40.746 --> 00:53:46.746
Than all His kingdom, than all His heaven, than all His crown and majesty.

45
00:53:46.746 --> 00:53:49.746
He was still greedy for one more thing.

46
00:53:49.746 --> 00:53:52.746
That is you and me.

47
00:53:52.746 --> 00:53:58.746
That is why He said, to gain Tim, I would rather die on a cross.

48
00:53:58.746 --> 00:54:01.746
So that I can have Him too.

49
00:54:02.746 --> 00:54:09.746
So Jesus initially said, more than anything I want to have Tim in my kingdom.

50
00:54:09.746 --> 00:54:12.746
So I am willing to die on a cross.

51
00:54:12.746 --> 00:54:17.746
For He is going to mess it up, I know how it should be done and I will pay the price.

52
00:54:17.746 --> 00:54:20.746
Can we give Him a round of applause, for He is amazing.

53
00:54:20.746 --> 00:54:24.746
A-ma-zing. Hallelujah.

54
00:54:25.746 --> 00:54:30.746
Dear people, give each other a, I wanted to say give each other a round of applause, but give each other a hand.

55
00:54:30.746 --> 00:54:33.746
Give each other a hand and a greeting.

56
00:54:33.746 --> 00:54:35.746
Get to know each other a little.

57
00:54:35.746 --> 00:54:37.746
Say hello, I am so and so.

58
00:54:37.746 --> 00:54:41.746
And welcome each other in the name of Jesus. Amen.

59
00:55:01.746 --> 00:55:03.746
I am hiding out of order.

60
00:55:08.746 --> 00:55:11.746
Yes, you, I love it.

61
00:55:11.746 --> 00:55:14.746
I'm a fan, I'm a fan.

62
00:55:14.746 --> 00:55:16.746
Me too.

63
00:55:16.746 --> 00:55:18.746
Really? Yes.

64
00:55:31.746 --> 00:55:33.746
Hallelujah.

65
00:55:35.746 --> 00:55:37.746
Wow.

66
00:55:37.746 --> 00:55:39.746
What grace.

67
00:55:40.746 --> 00:55:44.746
Jesus came to bring grace and truth.

68
00:55:44.746 --> 00:55:47.746
Do you know that? John, grace and truth.

69
00:55:47.746 --> 00:55:51.746
The beautiful thing about Jesus is that those two are always one hundred percent in balance.

70
00:55:51.746 --> 00:55:54.746
That is because they have a very beautiful collaboration.

71
00:55:55.746 --> 00:55:59.746
The beautiful thing about Jesus is that those two are always one hundred percent in balance.

72
00:55:59.746 --> 00:56:04.746
That is because his grace is one hundred percent pure and his truth is one hundred percent pure.

73
00:56:04.746 --> 00:56:08.746
Only we sometimes have different ideas about that as people.

74
00:56:09.746 --> 00:56:17.746
And it is so beautiful when we see that the truth of Jesus exposes every other thought that is not to his glory.

75
00:56:18.746 --> 00:56:20.746
And he truly sets us free.

76
00:56:21.746 --> 00:56:27.746
Jesus says come to me and then we often run to Jesus and then he will receive us.

77
00:56:27.746 --> 00:56:30.746
But do you know what is also important? That we also receive Jesus himself.

78
00:56:31.746 --> 00:56:34.746
Both must be true, they must receive each other.

79
00:56:34.746 --> 00:56:38.746
And then the truth of Christ is sometimes a bit like this...

80
00:56:40.746 --> 00:56:48.746
So pure that our ideas and our opinions can sometimes clash with it.

81
00:56:48.746 --> 00:56:51.746
And that is precisely grace.

82
00:56:52.746 --> 00:56:54.746
For He wants us to be completely free.

83
00:56:55.746 --> 00:56:58.746
And then it is necessary to transform as the Bible says.

84
00:56:59.746 --> 00:57:07.746
And when we read the Bible or when we are engaged with it or when we come to church or when we worship, as we tell Him.

85
00:57:08.746 --> 00:57:10.746
Everything, everything for You Jesus.

86
00:57:11.746 --> 00:57:13.746
Let us then also speak that truth.

87
00:57:13.746 --> 00:57:17.746
Let us then also speak the Word that we read in our lives.

88
00:57:18.746 --> 00:57:27.746
Or do we hold on to our own ideas and opinions very tightly for our convenience or comfort or perhaps out of a little fear.

89
00:57:28.746 --> 00:57:35.746
And I have learned, I have also had to learn to let go of things that I once learned.

90
00:57:36.746 --> 00:57:40.746
Because His Word was even more true than what I once thought I had learned.

91
00:57:40.746 --> 00:57:43.746
Because His Word was even more true than what I once thought I had learned.

92
00:57:55.746 --> 00:57:57.746
He is so good.

93
00:57:58.746 --> 00:58:00.746
He is so pure.

94
00:58:01.746 --> 00:58:05.746
Let us please also speak that truth together.

95
00:58:06.746 --> 00:58:11.746
Let us please not celebrate Jesus together and then go home unchanged.

96
00:58:12.746 --> 00:58:14.746
It is so important that we are transformed.

97
00:58:15.746 --> 00:58:16.746
This is true worship.

98
00:58:17.746 --> 00:58:21.746
When we receive Jesus in truth and in grace, then it is true worship.

99
00:58:22.746 --> 00:58:25.746
For this makes us more and more like Jesus.

100
00:58:30.746 --> 00:58:32.746
And that touches me.

101
00:58:35.746 --> 00:58:37.746
I did not think that.

102
00:58:40.746 --> 00:58:47.746
But it is so important that we look at his Word and that we also understand what he means by it.

103
00:58:48.746 --> 00:58:55.746
And if something cuts through flesh and spirit, then that is important.

104
00:58:55.746 --> 00:58:58.746
Because he really wants to bring separation in that.

105
00:58:59.746 --> 00:59:02.746
Why? Because he has your and my salvation in mind.

106
00:59:03.746 --> 00:59:05.746
And that he has your and my freedom in mind.

107
00:59:06.746 --> 00:59:10.746
And often it is also with instructions, especially with finances it is often the case.

108
00:59:11.746 --> 00:59:12.746
It is often the same with healing.

109
00:59:13.746 --> 00:59:15.746
It is with subjects that are sometimes difficult.

110
00:59:16.746 --> 00:59:18.746
Is God's Word true?

111
00:59:19.746 --> 00:59:20.746
Ah, that is sweet. Thank you.

112
00:59:21.746 --> 00:59:33.746
And the beauty of it is, his Word is so true and so good to grasp his Word.

113
00:59:34.746 --> 00:59:39.746
So that we also dare to think as Christians.

114
00:59:40.746 --> 00:59:46.746
And also things that are mentioned or said in the Old Testament, they have already been fulfilled by him.

115
00:59:46.746 --> 00:59:51.746
But why? Because we may learn obedience in a new way from our hearts.

116
00:59:52.746 --> 00:59:56.746
That we do it out of joy. Why? Because we know, he is it.

117
00:59:57.746 --> 01:00:03.746
And yes, we can think and do all sorts of things about it, but we will not really win against God.

118
01:00:04.746 --> 01:00:07.746
His Word is much more true than our opinions and our ideas.

119
01:00:08.746 --> 01:00:12.746
And the text I want to read today, we may have read very often.

120
01:00:13.746 --> 01:00:16.746
But the impact of it is so incredibly beautiful and so incredibly great.

121
01:00:17.746 --> 01:00:19.746
I want to go to Malachi 3 verses 10 and 11.

122
01:00:21.746 --> 01:00:24.746
And then they say, oh there he goes again. Yes, here I go again.

123
01:00:27.746 --> 01:00:35.746
But God Himself, who speaks to a people that has truly lost its way, because they had completely different views and ideas.

124
01:00:35.746 --> 01:00:37.746
And I have put that very mildly.

125
01:00:38.746 --> 01:00:41.746
He says, test me, says the Lord of hosts.

126
01:00:42.746 --> 01:00:47.746
Bring all the tithes into my storehouse, so that there may be food in my temple.

127
01:00:48.746 --> 01:00:53.746
And see if I will not open the floodgates of heaven for you.

128
01:00:54.746 --> 01:00:56.746
And pour out a blessing in abundance upon your land.

129
01:00:57.746 --> 01:01:04.746
I will make the locust, the devourer, harmless, so that he can no longer destroy the produce of the earth.

130
01:01:05.746 --> 01:01:11.746
And the grape cluster will no longer wither in the vineyards, says the Lord of hosts.

131
01:01:12.746 --> 01:01:19.746
All nations will call you blessed, for you will dwell in a delightful land, says the Lord of hosts.

132
01:01:20.746 --> 01:01:25.746
This text, which was true in the Old Covenant, is true again in the New Covenant.

133
01:01:26.746 --> 01:01:31.746
Only even more beautiful, because Jesus wants to plant this in our hearts and let it grow.

134
01:01:31.746 --> 01:01:38.746
And you also see the instruction that God gives, test me and bring all those tithes, is that instruction.

135
01:01:39.746 --> 01:01:43.746
And what He wants is for us to embrace this with a joyful heart.

136
01:01:44.746 --> 01:01:46.746
And if there is resistance, then He wants to set you free from that.

137
01:01:47.746 --> 01:01:52.746
And besides that, He also explains what the reward is.

138
01:01:53.746 --> 01:01:55.746
The reward is receiving the harvest.

139
01:01:56.746 --> 01:02:00.746
The freedom from the curse of provision, for there is a curse in this world.

140
01:02:01.746 --> 01:02:02.746
There is poverty in this world.

141
01:02:03.746 --> 01:02:05.746
And poverty destroys so much.

142
01:02:06.746 --> 01:02:09.746
In many ways, not just financially, but there is so much poverty in this world.

143
01:02:10.746 --> 01:02:13.746
That comes because God does not get the space, that His truth does not get the space.

144
01:02:14.746 --> 01:02:20.746
And yes, I actually want to encourage and urge us to take this word.

145
01:02:21.746 --> 01:02:24.746
And maybe once completely blank go into it again.

146
01:02:25.746 --> 01:02:28.746
And pray for it and worship Him and let this word sink in.

147
01:02:28.746 --> 01:02:29.746
For it is so important.

148
01:02:30.746 --> 01:02:35.746
Why? Because He gives promises that He will provide for everything.

149
01:02:36.746 --> 01:02:40.746
And here I want to bless us with when we bring back our gifts shortly.

150
01:02:41.746 --> 01:02:42.746
And I also want to say a prayer of thanks.

151
01:02:43.746 --> 01:02:44.746
Maybe it is nice to stand up.

152
01:02:48.746 --> 01:02:49.746
Father, thank You.

153
01:02:51.746 --> 01:02:57.746
Lord, You show, Lord, that the harvest, Lord, that comes further from our sowing, from believing.

154
01:02:58.746 --> 01:03:00.746
And obedience can only come from You.

155
01:03:01.746 --> 01:03:02.746
We are grateful for Your church.

156
01:03:03.746 --> 01:03:06.746
There is prosperity in this house, there is revelation in this house.

157
01:03:07.746 --> 01:03:10.746
Why? Because of the obedience to Your word.

158
01:03:11.746 --> 01:03:13.746
For we can learn a lot and listen to Your instructions.

159
01:03:14.746 --> 01:03:16.746
But we will only understand it when we obey You.

160
01:03:17.746 --> 01:03:21.746
Lord, we thank You. Lord, for our wonderful full-time pastors.

161
01:03:22.746 --> 01:03:24.746
Lord, we thank You for prophetic powerful teaching.

162
01:03:24.746 --> 01:03:31.746
We thank You for living powerful worship that makes our hearts receptive to the secrets of the Father and the victory in Christ.

163
01:03:32.746 --> 01:03:35.746
Thank You for prayer and watchfulness over our souls in our church.

164
01:03:36.746 --> 01:03:39.746
And also the body of Christ, so that darkness is driven away.

165
01:03:40.746 --> 01:03:42.746
So that we can see how good the Father truly is.

166
01:03:43.746 --> 01:03:44.746
For healing and restoration and provision.

167
01:03:45.746 --> 01:03:49.746
Thank You that we have encouragement, Lord, to a royal priesthood of our own.

168
01:03:49.746 --> 01:03:54.746
So that we may become strong in Christ and have assurance that we will be there when He returns.

169
01:03:55.746 --> 01:03:58.746
Thank You for supernatural wonders and signs.

170
01:03:59.746 --> 01:04:03.746
Thank You for equipping that leads to an unstoppable going in the name of Jesus.

171
01:04:04.746 --> 01:04:08.746
In our relationships, in our work, in our church, in our ministry and everything that comes with it.

172
01:04:09.746 --> 01:04:11.746
Thank You that Jesus becomes visible through all of us.

173
01:04:12.746 --> 01:04:14.746
So that God may achieve His purpose in this environment.

174
01:04:14.746 --> 01:04:23.746
Thank You that Jesus is known and that people will come to know Jesus here in the Kempen, in our countries and all nations through Your church.

175
01:04:24.746 --> 01:04:27.746
Those cannot be bought or earned or worked for by any of us.

176
01:04:28.746 --> 01:04:33.746
It can only be brought back and sown in faith through obedience and joy.

177
01:04:34.746 --> 01:04:36.746
That which the Father has long given us.

178
01:04:37.746 --> 01:04:41.746
And then only can You bless and multiply, that You will do.

179
01:04:41.746 --> 01:04:45.746
Lord, I pray that Your truth will set us free from the spirit of poverty from this world.

180
01:04:46.746 --> 01:04:50.746
Lord, I pray that Your truth will set us free from the spirit of greed in this world.

181
01:04:51.746 --> 01:04:56.746
Lord, I thank You that Your truth will set us free from Your generous provision in Jesus' wonderful name.

182
01:04:57.746 --> 01:04:58.746
To the honor and glorification of Your mighty name.

183
01:04:59.746 --> 01:05:01.746
All honor to Jesus and much blessing from the Giver.

184
01:05:11.746 --> 01:05:39.746
Good morning everyone. Are we ready for the Word of God?

185
01:05:40.746 --> 01:05:41.746
Then brace yourselves.

186
01:05:42.746 --> 01:05:44.746
Today we are going to tackle it, people.

187
01:05:45.746 --> 01:05:46.746
No time to waste.

188
01:05:47.746 --> 01:05:48.746
Shall we close our eyes?

189
01:05:49.746 --> 01:05:57.746
Lord, I want to ask You to wash us all with Your Word today.

190
01:05:58.746 --> 01:06:01.746
You have washed us with Your precious blood.

191
01:06:01.746 --> 01:06:12.746
You have washed us with Your precious blood and You are also the Word.

192
01:06:13.746 --> 01:06:16.746
In the beginning was the Word. The Word was with God.

193
01:06:17.746 --> 01:06:20.746
And the Word was God. The Word is God.

194
01:06:21.746 --> 01:06:35.746
And so when we believers listen to the Word of God and not just listen to God's Word as if it were information or just fun to look at or interesting.

195
01:06:36.746 --> 01:06:45.746
But when we allow ourselves to be washed by the Word, we are cleansed by the information of the power of God.

196
01:06:46.746 --> 01:06:48.746
Who spoke those words and they came into being.

197
01:06:48.746 --> 01:06:51.746
God said I want there to be light, and there was light.

198
01:06:52.746 --> 01:06:54.746
God said I want there to be birds, and there were birds.

199
01:06:55.746 --> 01:06:57.746
God said let us make man and there were men.

200
01:06:58.746 --> 01:07:08.746
When God's Word says something, it is so potent that it actually works things out in the physical, so deeply.

201
01:07:09.746 --> 01:07:15.746
And I was at this moment with the Holy Spirit through the Word of Jesus.

202
01:07:16.746 --> 01:07:18.746
So that it may transform us.

203
01:07:19.746 --> 01:07:22.746
And that we may become more and more like Jesus.

204
01:07:23.746 --> 01:07:24.746
In Jesus' mighty name.

205
01:07:25.746 --> 01:07:26.746
We all say Amen.

206
01:07:30.746 --> 01:07:34.746
We have a tough task ahead of us.

207
01:07:35.746 --> 01:07:38.746
I say every time, when you look behind you, the people who are sitting in front of that screen.

208
01:07:39.746 --> 01:07:42.746
When you look behind you, you see a screen and you see a timer and it is now counting down.

209
01:07:43.746 --> 01:07:45.746
After 30 minutes, I can never stick to it.

210
01:07:46.746 --> 01:07:50.746
Yes, I want to, but I also don't care about it.

211
01:07:53.746 --> 01:07:55.746
Praise A, Dominique I love you.

212
01:07:56.746 --> 01:07:58.746
I will also get a Snickers for you, okay?

213
01:07:59.746 --> 01:08:00.746
You will also get a Snickers.

214
01:08:01.746 --> 01:08:02.746
Praise the Lord.

215
01:08:02.746 --> 01:08:03.746
Snickers, delicious.

216
01:08:04.746 --> 01:08:05.746
Hallelujah.

217
01:08:06.746 --> 01:08:12.746
We are working on a Bible study and it is about the letter of Paul to the church in Ephesus.

218
01:08:13.746 --> 01:08:15.746
And it is a powerful letter.

219
01:08:16.746 --> 01:08:22.746
Paul is in prison and they also call these letters the prison letters.

220
01:08:23.746 --> 01:08:26.746
